#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:2
msgid "EncoderMotor Driver Unit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:8
msgid ""
"The ``EncoderMotorDriverUnit`` class controls Unit EncoderMotor Driver "
"over I2C. It supports signed open-loop PWM, position and speed control, "
"encoder feedback, motor sleep, soft start and stop, RGB LED control, and "
"input power monitoring."
msgstr ""
"``EncoderMotorDriverUnit`` 类通过 I2C 控制 Unit EncoderMotor Driver，支持电机正反转的开环"
" PWM 控制、位置控制、速度控制、编码器反馈、电机休眠、软启动和软停止、RGB LED 控制及输入电压和电流监测。"

#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:12
msgid "Support the following products:"
msgstr "支持以下产品："

