msgstr "UiFlow2 应用示例"

#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:20
#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:61
msgid "Basic Motor Control"
msgstr "基本电机控制"

#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:22
msgid ""
"Open the |m5cores3_unit_encoder_motor_driver_basic_example.m5f2| project "
"in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |m5cores3_unit_encoder_motor_driver_basic_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:24
msgid ""
"Select **CoreS3** and connect the Unit to **Port A** (``SDA=G2``, "
"``SCL=G1``, I2C 100 kHz). The default Unit address is ``0x2F``."
msgstr ""
"选择 **CoreS3** 作为主机，将 Unit 连接到 **Port A** 端口（``SDA=G2``、``SCL=G1``，I2C 频率为"
" 100 kHz）。Unit 的默认地址为 ``0x2F``。"

#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:27
msgid "The m5ui page provides three touch buttons:"
msgstr "m5ui 页面提供三个触摸按键："

#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:29
msgid ""
"**+** adds 20 percentage points to the signed PWM target. Pressing it "
"while the target is 80 sets the target to 0."
msgstr "**+**：每按一次，PWM 控制值加 20；当前值为 80 时，再按一次归零。"

#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:31
msgid ""
"**-** subtracts 20 percentage points from the signed PWM target. Pressing"
" it while the target is -80 sets the target to 0."
msgstr "**-**：每按一次，PWM 控制值减 20；当前值为 -80 时，再按一次归零。"

#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:33
msgid "**STOP** sets PWM to 0."
msgstr "**STOP**：将 PWM 控制值归零，停止电机。"

#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:35
msgid ""
"Positive and negative PWM select opposite directions. The center label "
"displays the commanded PWM percentage in the range ``-80~80``; it does "
"not display RPM or encoder counts. The target starts at 0."
msgstr ""
"PWM 控制值的正负表示相反的转动方向，绝对值表示占空比百分数。屏幕中央显示当前设置值，范围为 ``-80~80``，初始值为 0；此处显示的是 "
"PWM 设置值，而非转速或编码器计数。"

#: ../../source/unit/encoder_motor_driver.rst:41
msgid ""
"This example uses the Unit's default open-loop mode and enabled motor "
"driver. If a previous program selected a closed-loop mode or disabled the"
" driver, restore open-loop mode with ``set_motor_mode(MODE_OPEN_LOOP)`` "
"and enable it with ``enable_motor()`` before running this example. "
"Restarting the Unit also restores these runtime defaults. Motor power "
"must be present. Press **STOP** before ending the example."
msgstr ""
"本示例使用 Unit 默认的开环模式，电机驱动需处于启用状态。若之前的程序切换到了闭环模式或禁用了驱动，请先调用 "
"``set_motor_mode(MODE_OPEN_LOOP)`` 切回开环模式，并调用 ``enable_motor()`` 启用驱动。重启 "
"Unit 也可恢复这些默认设置。运行前请接好电机电源，结束示例前请按 **STOP** 停止电机。"

