#: of unit.encoder_motor_driver.EncoderMotorDriverUnit:1
msgid "Control the Unit EncoderMotor Driver over I2C."
msgstr "通过 I2C 控制 Unit EncoderMotor Driver。"

#: of unit.encoder_motor_driver.EncoderMotorDriverUnit:3
msgid ""
"The Unit supports signed open-loop PWM, position and speed control, "
"encoder feedback, motor sleep, soft start and stop, RGB LED control, and "
"input power monitoring. The object borrows the supplied I2C bus and does "
"not deinitialize it. If the configured address is not found, check the "
"Unit's Grove connection, power supply, and I2C address."
msgstr ""
"Unit 支持电机正反转的开环 PWM 控制、位置控制、速度控制、编码器反馈、电机休眠、软启动和软停止、RGB LED "
"控制及输入电压和电流监测。驱动使用传入的 I2C 总线，不会关闭该总线。未检测到指定地址时，请检查 Unit 的 Grove 接线、供电和 I2C"
" 地址。"

