#: of unit.encoder_motor_driver.EncoderMotorDriverUnit.read_motor_speed:1
msgid "Read the live device-native motor speed sample."
msgstr "读取电机当前的速度读数。"

#: of unit.encoder_motor_driver.EncoderMotorDriverUnit.read_motor_speed:3
msgid ""
"Signed native speed sample. Range: -127~127. The firmware updates this "
"value every 20 ms. It is not RPM and has no verified physical-unit "
"conversion."
msgstr "速度读数，可正可负，范围为 -127~127，固件每 20 ms 更新一次。该值未换算为转速（RPM），协议未提供相应的物理单位换算关系。"

