#: of unit.encoder_motor_driver.EncoderMotorDriverUnit.set_i2c_address:1
msgid "Set the Unit I2C address and switch this object to it."
msgstr "修改 Unit 的 I2C 地址，并更新当前驱动对象使用的地址。"

#: of unit.encoder_motor_driver.EncoderMotorDriverUnit.set_i2c_address:3
msgid ""
"A changed address is retained in the Unit's flash. The protocol states "
"that the Unit restarts and requires about 300 ms before responding at the"
" new address. This method waits and polls before updating the object's "
"address. Avoid unnecessary calls to limit flash writes."
msgstr ""
"新地址会保存到 Unit 的 Flash 中。根据协议，Unit 随后会重启，约 300 ms "
"后在新地址恢复响应。本方法会等待并检测新地址，确认响应后再更新驱动对象的地址。请避免不必要的调用，以减少 Flash 写入次数。"

#: of unit.encoder_motor_driver.EncoderMotorDriverUnit.set_i2c_address:8
msgid "New 7-bit I2C address. Range: 0x08~0x77."
msgstr "新的 7 位 I2C 地址，范围为 0x08~0x77。"

